OL,3,GNEWSA'Lessons need learnt' after report
OL,4,Ainto care homes during Covid published
OL,5,
OL,6,FLessons need to be learnt after an
OL,7,Finquiry found that Government failings
OL,8,Fin care settings allowed the spread of
OL,9,FCovid, a woman whose mother died during
OL,10,Fthe pandemic has said.
OL,12,FThe sixth report from the Covid
OL,13,Finquiry, which was published on
OL,14,FTuesday, said the care sector appeared
OL,15,Fto be "something of an afterthought" in
OL,16,Fthe early stages of the pandemic and
OL,17,Fthere was no "protective ring" put
OL,18,Faround homes as claimed by ministers at
OL,19,Fthe time.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
