OL,3,GNEWSA'Lessons need learnt' after report
OL,4,Ainto care homes during Covid published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were more than 43,000 recorded
OL,7,Fdeaths involving Covid in care homes
OL,8,Fbetween March 2020 and July 2022.
OL,10,FMartina Ferguson, whose mum Ursula
OL,11,FDerry died during the coronavirus
OL,12,Fpandemic, said "we really do need to
OL,13,Flearn from what's happened".
